   "detailed_description": "<h1>Year 11 Season 3 Overview</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/13b0ea3a0f50197fc9a9bfba7cf9a6eb.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/13b0ea3a0f50197fc9a9bfba7cf9a6eb.avif?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Year 11 Roadmap</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/052b4a833f86ae1f9212cf2ece523264.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/052b4a833f86ae1f9212cf2ece523264.webp?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>免費遊玩版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/bb07b716e101645e8063154bed752c2a.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/bb07b716e101645e8063154bed752c2a.avif?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>菁英版</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/8d20d7998486335f6b8b985fc2f7b9ee.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/8d20d7998486335f6b8b985fc2f7b9ee.avif?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/aedd3ff163e39b57935a413efa469e9f.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/aedd3ff163e39b57935a413efa469e9f.avif?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>PC Specifications</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/41a98c07fd0e02eb59353a8dcdc57769.avif?t=1792001976\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras_big/41a98c07fd0e02eb59353a8dcdc57769.avif?t=1792001976 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>關於此遊戲</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《虹彩六號：圍攻行動》是戰術團隊射擊遊戲中無庸置疑的典範，唯有透過絕妙的戰略和執行力才能在遊戲中獲勝。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >免費遊玩「快速對戰」與「排名練習戰」遊戲模式，並可選用一系列特勤幹員。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >特定內容需付款才可解鎖，如「排名戰」遊玩清單、《圍攻行動》盃，還有部分的特勤幹員及外觀物品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >激烈的 5 對 5 攻防體驗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在攻擊與防守之間切換，根據特勤幹員和地圖調整遊戲方式。在每一回合善加運用超乎想像的破壞手法與裝備智取對手，感受緊張刺激的動作場面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演防守方時，你可以將周遭環境改造成堅固的堡壘。強化牆面、設置封阻物，並部署陷阱來控制敵人的行動。使用監視工具蒐集情資，預測敵人的戰術。堅守陣地，依照對手戰術調整，並在各回合智取攻擊者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演攻擊方時，你可以使用無人機偵察敵人和炸彈的位置。與隊伍合作，突破強化防禦、繞過陷阱，打造意想不到的突入口。透過垂直進攻讓你的敵人措手不及——從上方或下方進攻，或大膽地藉由繩降從窗戶突入。規劃、執行攻擊，化解每一次難關。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >破壞工具</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >破壞並非只會造成混亂，也可能是你致勝的關鍵。善用周遭環境取得優勢，將牆面轉變為機會之窗。使用最先進的技術追蹤敵人的動向，破壞牆面來拓展視線，並改變周圍環境來確保戰術優勢。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >從新進人員到菁英</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲為新玩家準備了紮實的入門教學，包括新的許可等級階段，幫助玩家逐步學習基礎知識，並在實際投入戰術行動之前建立所需的技巧和信心。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >持續革新</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每個賽季都會推出重大更新，帶來全新內容與功能，提供煥然一新的戰術與玩法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >高度競技</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入這個超過 8,000 萬名玩家的超大線上社群。觀看頂尖職業隊伍在備受矚目的《虹彩六號：圍攻行動》電競賽事中爭奪霸主地位。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲可免費遊玩；特定內容需付款才可解鎖，如部分的競技遊戲模式、特勤幹員及外觀物品。</p>",
   "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《虹彩六號：圍攻行動》是戰術團隊射擊遊戲中無庸置疑的典範，唯有透過絕妙的戰略和執行力才能在遊戲中獲勝。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >免費遊玩「快速對戰」與「排名練習戰」遊戲模式，並可選用一系列特勤幹員。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >特定內容需付款才可解鎖，如「排名戰」遊玩清單、《圍攻行動》盃，還有部分的特勤幹員及外觀物品。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >激烈的 5 對 5 攻防體驗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在攻擊與防守之間切換，根據特勤幹員和地圖調整遊戲方式。在每一回合善加運用超乎想像的破壞手法與裝備智取對手，感受緊張刺激的動作場面。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/b46a642146a277ffa1700bb1008cd598.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演防守方時，你可以將周遭環境改造成堅固的堡壘。強化牆面、設置封阻物，並部署陷阱來控制敵人的行動。使用監視工具蒐集情資，預測敵人的戰術。堅守陣地，依照對手戰術調整，並在各回合智取攻擊者。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/d871f7238f08043965c734a172638018.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >扮演攻擊方時，你可以使用無人機偵察敵人和炸彈的位置。與隊伍合作，突破強化防禦、繞過陷阱，打造意想不到的突入口。透過垂直進攻讓你的敵人措手不及——從上方或下方進攻，或大膽地藉由繩降從窗戶突入。規劃、執行攻擊，化解每一次難關。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >破壞工具</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.poster.avif?t=1792001976\" width=780 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.webm?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359550/extras/a1d5a6afc4aefda6d913424d9a0a7645.mp4?t=1792001976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >破壞並非只會造成混亂，也可能是你致勝的關鍵。善用周遭環境取得優勢，將牆面轉變為機會之窗。使用最先進的技術追蹤敵人的動向，破壞牆面來拓展視線，並改變周圍環境來確保戰術優勢。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >從新進人員到菁英</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲為新玩家準備了紮實的入門教學，包括新的許可等級階段，幫助玩家逐步學習基礎知識，並在實際投入戰術行動之前建立所需的技巧和信心。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >持續革新</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每個賽季都會推出重大更新，帶來全新內容與功能，提供煥然一新的戰術與玩法。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >高度競技</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入這個超過 8,000 萬名玩家的超大線上社群。觀看頂尖職業隊伍在備受矚目的《虹彩六號：圍攻行動》電競賽事中爭奪霸主地位。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲可免費遊玩；特定內容需付款才可解鎖，如部分的競技遊戲模式、特勤幹員及外觀物品。</p>",
